OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAVisitor levy 'wrong tax at wrong
OL,4,Atime' says tourist board
OL,5,
OL,6,FSurrey will be unaffected by the recent
OL,7,Fdecision to pause restructuring plans
OL,8,Ffor more than a dozen authorities,
OL,9,Fmeaning a mayor could one day preside
OL,10,Fover East and West Surrey, the two new
OL,11,Funitary councils being created next
OL,12,Fyear.
OL,14,FChris Howard, chair of Visit Surrey,
OL,15,Ftold BBC Radio Surrey: "We're not a big
OL,16,Foverseas tourism destination, it's
OL,17,Flocal people - it's going to be another
OL,18,Ftax on local people."
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
